    ethernet.ipv6.sctp.syscom.cpuecprtitf.itf_cp_cpue_cprt_cprt_receivefromcpue.itf_cp_cpue_cprt_SCpUeCpRtSyscomCommunicationEnvelope.payload (itf_cp_cpue_cprt_embedded_f1ap).F1 Application Protocol (DLRRCMessageTransfer).F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.DLRRCMessageTransfer.protocolIEs.Item 3.ProtocolIE-Field.value.RRCContainer.1   ).NR Radio Resource Control (RRC) protocol.DL-DCCH-Message.message.c1.rrcReconfiguration.criticalExtensions.rrcReconfiguration.measConfig.reportConfigToAddModList.Item 0.ReportConfigToAddMod.reportConfig.reportConfigNR.reportType.periodical.rsType = 0

